### 3. Project Overview

#### 3.1. Objectives
- To strengthen the operational capabilities of the U.S. Armed Forces.
- To enhance security protocols for sensitive military installations and operations.
- To leverage advanced technologies in surveillance, communication, and data analysis.

#### 3.2. Scope of Work
- Implementation of the **Joint Tactical Networking** (JTN) system.
- Deployment of the **Integrated Air Defense System** (IADS).
- Development of secure communication networks through **SecureComm 5G** technology.
- Ongoing support and maintenance of all deployed systems.

